msgid "STM32F4 DCMI、I2S2／3 与 SAI1"
msgstr "STM32F4 DCMI, I2S2/3 and SAI1"

msgid "这里记录 `capture.c`、`audio.c`、`audio_blocks.c`、`audio_sai.c` 与同源静态装配的合同。 F407 DCMI／I2S 的 AF 路线来自 DS8626 Rev12，寄存器、DMA 与关闭时序来自 RM0090 Rev22， 精确软件参考为 STM32F407VET6／ZGT6。SAI1 另外限定 STM32F446ZET6 与 STM32F479NIH6，分别依据 DS10693 Rev11／RM0390 Rev9、DS11118 Rev8／RM0386 Rev6。 这些软件范围不表示摄像头、codec、PCB 接线、电气时序或物理 HIL 已执行。"
msgstr "This page records the contracts of `capture.c`, `audio.c`, `audio_blocks.c`, `audio_sai.c` and their shared static assembly. F407 DCMI/I2S AF routes come from DS8626 Rev12; registers, DMA and stop ordering come from RM0090 Rev22. The exact software references are STM32F407VET6/ZGT6. SAI1 separately targets STM32F446ZET6 and STM32F479NIH6, using DS10693 Rev11/RM0390 Rev9 and DS11118 Rev8/RM0386 Rev6 respectively. These software scopes do not establish camera, codec, PCB wiring, electrical timing or physical HIL execution."

msgid "静态配置、资源责任与公共调用边界参见共享图示。"
msgstr "See the shared diagram for static configuration, resource responsibility and public call boundaries."

msgid "[F4 源码归属与接口边界](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"
msgstr "[F4 source ownership and interface boundaries](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"

msgid "图表示当前源码和依赖关系；具体模式、关闭证明和时间域规则以下文为准。"
msgstr "The diagram shows current source and dependency relationships. The sections below define exact modes, shutdown proof and time-domain rules."

msgid "图示区分构建输入与运行期调用，不表示吞吐保证。factory 只返回已有 `nx_capture_t` 或 `nx_audio_t`。Platform prepare 取得资源并配置格式，不启动 CAPTURE、I2SE、SAIEN 或一次 DMA 传输；应用通过公共 face 提交有限请求、启动 RAW／JPEG storage blocks 或 CM1 帧会话。 Platform close 调用同一个 C owner 排空，失败会阻止 System 退出，保留全部借用和 精确清理责任。没有 heap、运行时名字注册表、默认 buffer pool 或后台任务。"
msgstr "The diagram distinguishes build inputs from runtime calls and makes no throughput guarantee. Factory lookup returns an existing `nx_capture_t` or `nx_audio_t`. Platform prepare acquires resources and configures the format without starting CAPTURE, I2SE, SAIEN or a DMA transfer. Applications submit finite requests or start RAW/JPEG storage blocks or CM1 frame sessions through public faces. Platform close drains through the same C owner. Failure prevents System withdrawal and retains every borrow and exact cleanup responsibility. There is no heap, runtime name registry, default buffer pool or background task."

msgid "DCMI 的 stream、slot 表、request／RAW frame 控制及每个 payload 的完整容量不得 覆盖 provider 配置、DMA 域表、引脚事实或逐 pin 的恢复 snapshot。所有未来 block 在首个 producer loan 或 request 接纳前一起检查，不能把尚未使用的 payload 尾部 用作仍需读取的配置或关闭收条。此检查不增加 frame／buffer 分配或新的采集模式。"
msgstr "DCMI stream and slot controls, request/RAW-frame metadata and the full capacity of every payload must not overlap provider configuration, DMA-region tables, pin facts or per-pin restoration snapshots. All future blocks are checked before the first producer loan or request acceptance. Unused payload tails cannot store configuration or shutdown receipts that remain live. This check adds no frame/buffer allocation or capture mode."

msgid "DCMI 输入与模式"
msgstr "DCMI inputs and modes"

msgid "`capture` 选择 `snapshot-raw`、`snapshot-jpeg`、`raw-blocks`、`jpeg-blocks`、`frames-raw` 或 `frames-jpeg`；后两种是有限 CM1 快照会话，不能解释为无缝连续图像。 8-bit RAW 每四个输入样本存入一个 32-bit DMA word；10／12／14-bit RAW 的每个样本 占一个 16-bit 容器，有效数据在低位，不是紧密位打包。VE 最多选择 12-bit；14-bit 需要 ZG 的 PF11／PG15。所有路线 AF13，D0–D7 为 PC6／PC7／PC8／PC9／PC11／PB6／PB8／PB9，D8–D11 为 PC10／PC12／PB5／PD2，PCLK 为 PA6。hardware sync 另取 PA4 HSYNC、PB7 VSYNC； 8-bit embedded sync 不取得这两根 pad 或未用高位 pad。"
msgstr "`capture` selects `snapshot-raw`, `snapshot-jpeg`, `raw-blocks`, `jpeg-blocks`, `frames-raw` or `frames-jpeg`. The last two are finite CM1 snapshot sessions, not seamless continuous images. Eight-bit RAW stores four input samples in one 32-bit DMA word. Each 10/12/14-bit RAW sample occupies a 16-bit container with significant data in the low bits; it is not tightly bit-packed. VE supports at most 12 bits; 14 bits requires ZG pins PF11/PG15. All routes use AF13. D0–D7 are PC6/PC7/PC8/PC9/PC11/PB6/PB8/PB9, D8–D11 are PC10/PC12/PB5/PD2 and PCLK is PA6. Hardware synchronization also acquires PA4 HSYNC and PB7 VSYNC; eight-bit embedded synchronization acquires neither these pads nor unused high data pads."

msgid "embedded 必须显式给出 frame-start、line-start、line-end、frame-end 四个 byte code。官方 `HAL_DCMI_Init` 的 READY 状态只绕过 MSP，仍启用 LINE／VSYNC／ERR／OVR； owner 先持有责任，再掩蔽并回读 IER。官方 Init 不写 ESUR，因此这里显式写入并观察 四个 `0xff` unmask。栈上 Handle 的 State／Lock 明确初始化，热态 IRQ 和 DMA 不引用该 Handle。crop 参数直接表示输入 clock／line 计数，按寄存器存储，不额外 减一，也不把它们解释成输出像素长宽。JPEG 不允许 crop 或 embedded sync。"
msgstr "Embedded sync explicitly declares frame-start, line-start, line-end and frame-end byte codes. Official `HAL_DCMI_Init` in READY state skips MSP only and still enables LINE/VSYNC/ERR/OVR. The owner records responsibility first, then masks and reads back IER. Official Init does not write ESUR, so the provider explicitly installs and observes four `0xff` unmask bytes. The stack Handle has explicitly initialized State/Lock; hot IRQ/DMA paths do not reference it. Crop parameters directly describe input clock/line counts stored in registers. They are neither decremented nor interpreted as output pixel dimensions. JPEG rejects crop and embedded sync."

msgid "`pixel_clock_hz` 是调用者声明的实际输入上界，必须同时满足 54 MHz 电气上限及 PIXCLK/HCLK≤0.4。它用于软件观测预算，不是总线持续吞吐资格；sensor、DMA 仲裁及 并发负载仍需物理验证。DMA2 只取得 stream1 或 stream7、channel1；选择冲突会在 同一资源图中拒绝，包括 stream1 与 ADC3 默认 DMA 路线的冲突。ES0182 Rev19 §2.2.19 列出的受影响访问为 QUADSPI indirect、带 FIFO 的 FSMC 外设读写，以及 DMA2 memory-to-peripheral 写 GPIO。该条没有声明 DCMI＋ADC 通用禁用；这里的 DCMI P2M peripheral port→SRAM memory port 没有选择上述外部 FIFO／GPIO 写路径。 这不证明全部 DMA 并发吞吐或丢帧边界，实际负载仍需 HIL 验证。"
msgstr "`pixel_clock_hz` is the caller-declared actual input upper bound and must satisfy both the 54 MHz electrical limit and PIXCLK/HCLK≤0.4. It supports software observation budgeting, not sustained bus-throughput qualification. Sensors, DMA arbitration and concurrent loads still need hardware validation. DMA2 uses stream1 or stream7 channel1; the common resource graph rejects conflicts, including stream1 versus the default ADC3 DMA route. ES0182 Rev19 §2.2.19 lists QUADSPI indirect accesses, FSMC peripheral reads/writes with FIFOs and DMA2 memory-to-peripheral GPIO writes. It does not declare a general DCMI+ADC prohibition. This DCMI P2M peripheral-port-to-SRAM-memory-port path selects none of those external-FIFO/GPIO-write paths. This does not qualify all concurrent DMA throughput or frame-loss bounds; actual loads still need HIL."

msgid "Snapshot 与 JPEG 前缀"
msgstr "Snapshot and JPEG prefixes"

msgid "调用者初始化 stream 和 request。RAW 还将同一个 stream 绑定到一份完整、连续的 `nx_frame_stream_t`，请求 `storage_bytes` 与该布局精确相等。RAW 要求 FRAME、 完整存储计数、CAPTURE 退出、DCMI FIFO 空、DMA 总线停止、两个 IRQ 实际排空及地址 解绑全部成立，才发布完整 frame。空 crop 也可能产生 FRAME，因此单有 FRAME 不代表完整 RAW 图像。"
msgstr "The caller initializes stream and request. RAW additionally binds that same stream to a complete contiguous `nx_frame_stream_t`; request `storage_bytes` must equal its layout exactly. A complete RAW frame requires FRAME, complete storage count, CAPTURE withdrawal, empty DCMI FIFO, stopped DMA bus, actual drain of both IRQs and detached addresses. An empty crop can also produce FRAME; FRAME alone does not prove a complete RAW image."

msgid "JPEG 使用普通 stream，`raw_frame=NULL`。正常短图不会触发 DMA TC：FRAME 到达后 等待 CAPTURE 退出和 DCMI FIFO 排空，再停止 DMA，观察稳定 NDTR。返回的 `base.transferred` 和 block length 以字节计，表示按 32-bit word 对齐的已存储前缀， 包含最后一字中的硬件补零，绝不等于 JPEG 有效 codestream 字节数。应用自行解析 SOI／EOI／长度。 RAW 和 JPEG 每次 snapshot 的存储上界为 65535 个 DMA words，且须完整位于已审 DMA 可达域；CCM 被排除。大图可用相应的 RAW／JPEG storage blocks，但这些块没有图像边界保证。"
msgstr "JPEG uses an ordinary stream with `raw_frame=NULL`. A short image normally produces no DMA TC. After FRAME, the provider waits for CAPTURE exit and an empty DCMI FIFO, stops DMA and observes stable NDTR. `base.transferred` and block length count bytes in the stored prefix, aligned to 32-bit words and including hardware zero padding in the last word. They never give the valid JPEG codestream length. The application parses SOI/EOI/lengths. Each RAW or JPEG snapshot is limited to 65535 DMA words wholly inside a reviewed DMA-accessible region; CCM is excluded. Large images may use the corresponding RAW/JPEG storage-block mode, whose blocks have no image-boundary guarantee."

msgid "snapshot 硬件忽略 FCRC，因此 snapshot 的 `frame_divisor` 只能为 1。连续 RAW／JPEG 可 选择 1／2／4，表示输入帧筛选，而非准确输出 N 帧。没有按可合并 FRAME bit 与 NDTR 推导精确帧数的接口。"
msgstr "Snapshot hardware ignores FCRC, so snapshot `frame_divisor` must be 1. Continuous RAW/JPEG may select 1/2/4, filtering input frames rather than guaranteeing exactly N output frames. No interface derives an exact frame count from a coalescing FRAME bit and NDTR."

msgid "连续 RAW／JPEG storage blocks"
msgstr "Continuous RAW/JPEG storage blocks"

msgid "应用给出至少三个等容量、四字节对齐的 stream slots 和明确 `max_service_gap_us`。owner 用已有 posted producer 借用两个 DMA targets，并在每个 可信 TC 后取得 replacement、更新非活动 target、再次观察 CT／TC，然后 FIFO 发布脱离硬件的旧 target。块是连续存储片段，不是完整图像或精确帧数。"
msgstr "The application supplies at least three equally sized, four-byte-aligned stream slots and an explicit `max_service_gap_us`. The owner uses the existing posted producer to borrow two DMA targets. After each trustworthy TC it obtains a replacement, updates the inactive target and rechecks CT/TC before FIFO-publishing the detached old target. Blocks are continuous storage chunks, not complete images or exact frame counts."

msgid "`jpeg-blocks` 明确选择 CM0、8-bit hardware sync 和 JPEG packing，禁止 embedded sync 或 crop。RM0090 Rev22 §15.5.6 p467 规定每个完整 32-bit word 触发 DMA，帧尾残字补零 后同样触发 DMA。因此它原样发布存储字，不解析 SOI／EOI，不提供精确 JPEG 字节长或 帧边界标志；一个 block 可以跨帧并包含 padding。FRAME 不作为完成依据，连续 JPEG 只启用 DCMI error／overrun IRQ；DMA TC 和两个 bank 的借用交接决定 block 发布。 selected-contract 的单位为四字节 word；普通 stream 的 block length 仍以字节计， 且为四的整数倍。"
msgstr "`jpeg-blocks` explicitly selects CM0, eight-bit hardware synchronization and JPEG packing; embedded synchronization and cropping are rejected. RM0090 Rev22 §15.5.6 p467 specifies a DMA request for every complete 32-bit word and another for a frame-end partial word after zero padding. The provider publishes these storage words unchanged. It parses no SOI/EOI, supplies no exact JPEG byte length or frame-boundary flags, and a block may span frames and include padding. FRAME is not completion evidence. Continuous JPEG enables only DCMI error/overrun IRQs; DMA TC and the ownership handoff between both banks determine publication. Selected-contract units are four-byte words; ordinary stream block lengths still count bytes and are multiples of four."

msgid "双缓冲 CT 只能观察当前 bank，不能恢复丢失的两次或三次翻转。两次显式 service 的间隔 必须在 `max_service_gap_us=G` 内。两种 blocks 共用保守准入：容量 `B` 为四字节整数倍， 每个 bank 不超过 65535 DMA words，并满足 `(B-44)*1000000 > (2*G+2)*R`。 `R` 的单位为 byte/s：8-bit RAW 使用 `PIXCLK`，10／12／14-bit RAW 使用 `2*PIXCLK`， JPEG 使用 `4*PIXCLK`，不能以平均每四拍一个 word 忽略短帧补零。44 B 保守预留一个 packing word、DCMI 四 word FIFO、DMA 四 word FIFO，以及两个独立 AHB master 各一个 SINGLE 在途 word；两微秒另覆盖 tick 观察相位。依据是 §15.5.6／7、§15.8.11 的 packing／FIFO 和 §10.3 的 DMA 双端口；这不是总线吞吐实测。"
msgstr "Double-buffer CT identifies only the current bank; it cannot reconstruct two or three missed flips. Explicit service calls must remain within `max_service_gap_us=G`. Both block modes use conservative admission: capacity `B` is a multiple of four, each bank contains at most 65535 DMA words, and `(B-44)*1000000 > (2*G+2)*R`. `R` counts bytes/s: `PIXCLK` for eight-bit RAW, `2*PIXCLK` for 10/12/14-bit RAW and `4*PIXCLK` for JPEG. Average packing of four clocks per word cannot exclude short-frame padding. The 44 B reserve covers one packing word, four DCMI FIFO words, four DMA FIFO words and one in-flight SINGLE word at each independent AHB master. Two additional microseconds cover tick-observation phase. The basis is the packing/FIFO description in §15.5.6/7 and §15.8.11 and the dual-port DMA in §10.3; this is not a measured bus-throughput result."

msgid "共用检查收紧了旧 RAW 仅预留 32 B 的过松准入；例如 8-bit RAW 在 1 MHz／10 µs 的 64 B bank 现在拒绝，68 B 可准入，不静默增加应用 buffer。全部 bank 仍由调用者显式提供。"
msgstr "The shared check tightens the old RAW admission, which reserved only 32 B. For example, for eight-bit RAW at 1 MHz/10 µs a 64 B bank is now rejected and a 68 B bank is admissible. The provider never silently enlarges an application buffer; the caller still supplies every bank explicitly."

msgid "超预算、CT 歧义、替换期间 bank 切换或没有 replacement 时停止并报告 LOSS，不能 覆盖 READY／BORROWED。LOSS 只表示确实观察到一次无法继续的边界，不虚构错过的帧数。 IRQ 只锁存事实，应用必须主动 service，不创建隐式 worker。"
msgstr "An exceeded budget, ambiguous CT, a bank switch during replacement or a missing replacement stops capture and reports LOSS; READY/BORROWED data is never overwritten. LOSS records an observed inability to continue, not an invented count of missed frames. IRQs only latch facts. The application must call service explicitly; there is no hidden worker."

msgid "取消及关闭可能等待 sensor 帧尾后才看到 CAPTURE 清除；sensor 停钟会使退出失败。 失败保留 request、stream、两个 targets 以及已经取得的第三个 replacement。 显式 `recover` 先观察 DMA 禁用和 IRQ 排空，再只复位独占的 DCMI；绝不 reset 共享 DMA2。丢失 clock／reset／System epoch 历史的借用不能靠恢复成 reset 外观来撤销。"
msgstr "Cancellation/close may wait until a sensor frame ends before CAPTURE clears; a stopped sensor clock can prevent withdrawal. Failure retains request, stream, both targets and an already-acquired third replacement. Explicit `recover` first observes DMA disabled and IRQs drained, then resets only the exclusive DCMI, never shared DMA2. Restoring a reset-like register appearance cannot revoke borrowing after lost clock/reset/System-epoch history."

msgid "source／DMA 已退出也不撤销 READY／BORROWED consumer；这些块未归还时 stop 返回 BUSY，调用者显式 acquire／release 后重试，才完成整个 stream 的关闭。"
msgstr "Source/DMA withdrawal does not revoke READY/BORROWED consumer blocks. Stop returns BUSY until these blocks are returned. The caller explicitly acquires/releases them and retries to finish closing the entire stream."

msgid "有限 CM1 完整帧会话"
msgstr "Finite CM1 complete-frame sessions"

msgid "`frames-raw`／`frames-jpeg` 使用 `nx_capture_frames_request_t` 和显式 `capture->ops->start_frames(capture->context, &request)`。调用者提供正 `frame_count`、有限绝对 deadline、完整 stream 及每帧存储；RAW 要求与 `raw_frame` 的精确布局相等，JPEG 将 `storage_bytes` 作为每帧容量。每帧仍受 65535 DMA words 上限和完整 DMA 域约束。"
msgstr "`frames-raw`/`frames-jpeg` use `nx_capture_frames_request_t` and explicit `capture->ops->start_frames(capture->context, &request)`. The caller supplies a positive `frame_count`, a finite absolute deadline, the complete stream and per-frame storage. RAW must exactly match the `raw_frame` layout; JPEG uses `storage_bytes` as each frame capacity. Every frame remains subject to the 65535-DMA-word limit and complete DMA-domain checks."

msgid "每次 CM1 快照都先完成 source、FIFO、DMA、IRQ 和地址 join，再发布该完整帧并 重启下一帧。两个帧之间存在间隙，不提供 CM0 无缝完整帧或无丢帧保证。"
msgstr "Each CM1 snapshot completely joins the source, FIFO, DMA, IRQs and addresses before publishing its complete frame and starting the next. Rearming creates a gap. Seamless complete CM0 frames and lossless capture are not promised."

msgid "CM0 连续 JPEG 的精确帧边界尚未开放。RM0090 Rev22 §15.5 pp458–462 明确帧同步、 变长 JPEG 和 32-bit packing，§15.8 的 FRAME 状态没有同时锁存 DMA NDTR／CT 的 寄存器。FRAME IRQ 后读取 DMA 指针不能证明该字节属于前一帧；FIFO／最后 word 还可能包含 padding。这里限制的是当前可证明的软件合同，不否认芯片能够连续接收 JPEG。`jpeg-blocks` 已覆盖无帧界的 CM0 存储字流。当前完整帧替代是上述 CM1 rearm； 如产品确需 CM0 完整帧，应先明确传感器边界握手、 最坏 IRQ／DMA 观测界限或外部帧解析接口，再建立单独可验证的合同。"
msgstr "Exact frame boundaries for continuous CM0 JPEG remain unavailable. RM0090 Rev22 §15.5 pp458–462 describes frame synchronization, variable-length JPEG and 32-bit packing; the FRAME status in §15.8 has no register that atomically latches DMA NDTR/CT. Reading the DMA pointer after FRAME IRQ cannot prove which frame owns a byte, and the FIFO/last word may contain padding. This limits the currently provable software contract; it does not deny the chip's continuous JPEG reception capability. `jpeg-blocks` provides the CM0 storage-word stream without frame boundaries. CM1 rearming remains the complete-frame alternative. A product requiring complete CM0 frames must first define sensor-boundary handshaking, worst-case IRQ/DMA observation bounds or an external frame-parsing interface, then establish a separately verifiable contract."

msgid "没有 FREE slot 时 source 保持关闭，等待调用者归还 consumer block；会话的绝对 时间预算继续消耗，驱动不覆盖 READY／BORROWED，也不分配替代 buffer。"
msgstr "Without a FREE slot, the source stays off until the caller returns a consumer block. The absolute session deadline continues running. The provider neither overwrites READY/BORROWED storage nor allocates replacement buffers."

msgid "会话 `base.transferred` 统计已成功发布的完整帧数，失败保留这个有效前缀；JPEG 每帧 block length 以字节计，仍含 DMA 最后 word 的硬件 padding，不是 codestream 字节数。stop 取消并 join 当前 producer／硬件责任，不能撤销之前已发布的 consumer loans。 应用独立归还这些 loans 后才能回收 stream、控制或 payload。"
msgstr "Session `base.transferred` counts successfully published complete frames and preserves that valid prefix on failure. Each JPEG block length counts bytes including hardware padding in the final DMA word, not codestream bytes. Stop cancels and joins the current producer/hardware responsibility but cannot revoke previously published consumer loans. Applications return those loans independently before reclaiming stream, control or payload storage."

msgid "同一会话保留最初 System epoch，包括每个 deliberate source-off 间隙。clock 历史 丢失、DMA／IRQ／地址拒撤时保留 request、stream 和当前存储，不把重新启动外设 或寄存器 reset 外观当作过去借用已经退出。该合同只规定软件退出与帧发布边界， 不建立 sensor 配置、电气连接或实测图像质量资格。"
msgstr "A session retains its original System epoch through every deliberate source-off gap. Lost clock history or refused DMA/IRQ/address withdrawal retains the request, stream and current storage. Restarting a peripheral or restoring a reset-like register appearance does not prove that earlier borrows have ended. This contract defines software withdrawal and frame publication, not sensor configuration, electrical wiring or measured image quality."

msgid "音频存储布局查询"
msgstr "Audio storage layout queries"

msgid "应用通过同一个 `nx_audio_t` 和 `nx_audio_port_layout` 查询已准备实例的存储事实； 不能仅凭 24-bit／32-bit 采样精度推测内存顺序。查询不分配、等待时钟或转换数据， 原始 output 指针直接交给 provider 检查，不用临时结果绕过私有控制与借用别名约束。"
msgstr "Applications query a prepared instance through the same `nx_audio_t` and `nx_audio_port_layout`. A24-bit or 32-bit sample width alone does not determine memory order. The query neither allocates, waits for clocks nor converts data. Its original output pointer goes directly to provider validation; no temporary result bypasses private control or borrow-alias checks."

msgid "实现"
msgstr "Implementation"

msgid "有效采样位"
msgstr "Significant sample bits"

msgid "每个样本的内存容器"
msgstr "Memory container per sample"

msgid "有效位位置／存储顺序"
msgstr "Significant-bit position/storage order"

