msgid "全部有效；HIGH halfword 后接 LOW halfword"
msgstr "All bits significant; HIGH halfword followed by LOW halfword"

msgid "SAI"
msgstr "SAI"

msgid "8／10／16／20／24／32"
msgstr "8/10/16/20/24/32"

msgid "8／16／16／32／32／32 bit"
msgstr "8/16/16/32/32/32 bit"

msgid "LSB；native little endian"
msgstr "LSB; native little endian"

msgid "`sample_alignment` 表示容器内有效位的位置，不是 buffer 地址对齐；`container_bits` 表示内存宽度，不是包含 padding 的 wire slot 宽度。`slots` 和 `active_slots` 明确 每帧的存储 slots 与 wire mask；首批 SAI 只允许全部 slots 有效，不压缩稀疏 mask。 SAI 10-bit 数据使用既有 frame planner 的 16-bit 容器，不能把该格式传成 I2S。"
msgstr "`sample_alignment` locates significant bits within a container; it does not specify buffer-address alignment. `container_bits` is the memory width, not the padded wire-slot width. `slots` and `active_slots` identify stored frame slots and the wire mask. The initial SAI provider requires every slot active and does not pack sparse masks. SAI 10-bit data uses the existing frame planner's 16-bit container; it must not be passed as an I2S format."

msgid "layout／rate 的结果不得覆盖完整 System 对象、私有 state／config、资源描述表、引脚 恢复 snapshot 或任一在借控制与 payload 的完整 capacity。查询没有新增每实例状态； 只读共享 ops 增加可选 layout 方法，原接口仍直接进入同一个硬件 owner。"
msgstr "Layout/rate output must not overlap the complete System object, private state/configuration, resource tables, pin-restoration snapshots or the entire capacity of any borrowed control or payload. The query adds no per-instance state. Shared readonly ops add one optional layout method; the existing interface still enters the same hardware owner directly."

msgid "I2S2／3 格式、时钟与有限 DMA"
msgstr "I2S2/3 formats, clocks and finite DMA"

msgid "`audio` 选择 master／slave 与 tx／rx／duplex 六种模式，支持 Philips、MSB justified、 LSB justified、PCM short／long，16／24／32-bit data，16 或 32-bit wire slots。 16-bit data 在 32-bit slot 的低 16 位由硬件补零，内存仍只用一个 halfword；24／32-bit 每个样本用两个 halfwords，内存按 HIGH halfword、LOW halfword 的 DMA 顺序存储， 不是 native little-endian uint32 PCM。I2S／justified frame 含两个 channel slots； PCM frame 是一个单通道同步周期。owner 不转换数据、复制音频或选择 codec。"
msgstr "`audio` selects six master/slave × tx/rx/duplex modes, supporting Philips, MSB justified, LSB justified, PCM short/long, 16/24/32-bit data and 16- or32-bit wire slots. Hardware pads the low16 bits of 16-bit data in a32-bit slot; memory still uses one halfword. A24/32-bit sample occupies two halfwords in DMA order HIGH then LOW, not native little-endian uint32 PCM. I2S/justified frames contain two channel slots; a PCM frame is one mono synchronization period. The owner neither converts/copies audio nor selects a codec."

msgid "I2S2 用 PB12 WS／PB13 CK／PB15 SD AF5，extension RX 用 PB14 AF6，MCLK 用 PC6 AF5。 I2S3 用 PA15 WS／PC10 CK／PC12 SD AF6，extension RX 用 PC11 AF5，MCLK 用 PC7 AF6。 不选择 extension 或 MCLK 时不取得对应 pad。主接收、主发送及 slave simplex 分别 使用其精确 DMA request；duplex 由主单元 TX 配合 extension RX 共享 CK／WS。普通 SPI2／3 personality、pad 或 DMA 路线冲突在配置期拒绝。"
msgstr "I2S2 uses PB12 WS/PB13 CK/PB15 SD AF5, extension RX on PB14 AF6 and MCLK on PC6 AF5. I2S3 uses PA15 WS/PC10 CK/PC12 SD AF6, extension RX on PC11 AF5 and MCLK on PC7 AF6. Unselected extension/MCLK pads are not acquired. Master RX, master TX and slave simplex use their exact DMA requests; duplex uses main-unit TX plus extension RX with shared CK/WS. Configuration rejects ordinary SPI2/3 personality, pad and DMA-route conflicts."

msgid "master 显式选择 PLLI2S N／R、目标采样率和最大名义分频 ppm 误差。PLLI2S 复用 System 的 source／M；生成器计算精确有理数名义 rate 和 I2SDIV／ODD，不把分频误差当作振荡器物理精度。 两个音频 owner 共享同一个兼容 PLLI2S lease；最后一个关闭者才撤回新增 PLLI2S， 不会修改主 PLL 或共享 DMA1。slave 不取得 PLLI2S、不生成 MCLK，rate 查询返回 0/0 unknown，不虚构外部 master 采样率。"
msgstr "Master mode explicitly selects PLLI2S N/R, target sampling rate and maximum nominal divider error in ppm. PLLI2S shares System source/M. The generator computes exact rational nominal rate and I2SDIV/ODD; divider error is not physical oscillator accuracy. Two audio owners share one compatible PLLI2S lease; the last close withdraws only newly added PLLI2S without changing the main PLL or shared DMA1. Slave mode acquires no PLLI2S, generates no MCLK and reports rate0/0 unknown rather than inventing the external master rate."

msgid "TX 接受现有 `nx_frame_dma_loan_t`，RX 从调用者的 framed stream 借用一个 fill； duplex 要求两个方向等长完整块。DMA 以 halfword 为单位，每方向最多 65535 个。 外部 slave 时序由应用协调：准备时 CK 保持所选 idle level，WS 在 Philips 为 HIGH、 其他标准为 LOW。只有 acquire-observed ACTIVE 才启动外部 clock。slave TX 的 ACTIVE 需要真实 DR prefill、精确 NDTR=N−1、TXE=0、使能后至少三个实际微秒 tick 及 三个外设 clock，并再次确认 CK／WS 仍保持 idle。"
msgstr "TX accepts an existing `nx_frame_dma_loan_t`; RX borrows a fill from the caller framed stream. Duplex requires equal-length complete blocks. DMA counts halfwords, at most65535 per direction. The application coordinates external slave timing: CK stays at the selected idle level during preparation; WS is HIGH for Philips and LOW for other standards. External clocks start only after acquire-observed ACTIVE. Slave TX requires actual DR prefill, exact NDTR=N−1, TXE=0, at least three actual microsecond ticks and three peripheral clocks after enable, then a repeated CK/WS idle check before ACTIVE."

msgid "TX 关闭观察 DMA EN0、TXE1、随后新读到 BSY0，再撤销 I2SE。主 RX 的 BSY 始终为0， 因此采用 RM0090 专用序列：按格式在 n−1 或最后一个 DMA halfword 后，用保留原值的 DWT CYCCNT 观察 1 CK（16-bit extended LSB 为17 CK），撤销 I2SE，必要时从 DR 取 最后一个 CPU halfword。迟到的 RXNE／OVR 不能变成成功证明。DWT 的新增使能位也有 共享收条，最后关闭时恢复。有限主 RX 至少需要两个存储 halfwords。实际 IRQ 延迟、clock 波形与关闭窗口仍需物理 HIL 验证。"
msgstr "TX shutdown observes DMA EN0, TXE1, then a fresh BSY0 before withdrawing I2SE. Master RX always has BSY0 and uses the RM0090-specific sequence: after n−1 or the final DMA halfword according to format, retained DWT CYCCNT observes1 CK (17 CK for16-bit extended LSB), I2SE is withdrawn and a final CPU halfword is read from DR when needed. Late RXNE/OVR cannot establish success. Newly enabled DWT bits also have shared receipts restored at final close. Finite master RX requires at least two storage halfwords. Actual IRQ latency, clocks and shutdown windows still require physical HIL."

msgid "错误／取消报告零个有效音频字节。DMA TC、NDTR0、timeout 或停止 clock 都不直接 归还借用；Serializer／DMA／IRQ／地址全部排空后才归还 TX 或发布 RX。任何失败 保留完整 request 和未归还 loans，close 不允许 System 提前退出。所有 deadline 包含最终排空，重新建立 System epoch 后的旧借用保持 quarantine。"
msgstr "Error/cancellation reports zero valid audio bytes. DMA TC, NDTR0, timeout or stopping clocks never directly returns a borrow. TX is returned or RX published only after serializer/DMA/IRQ/address drain. Failure retains the complete request and outstanding loans and prevents premature System close. Deadlines include final drain. Outstanding borrows from the previous System epoch remain quarantined after a new epoch is established."

msgid "连续 I2S blocks"
msgstr "Continuous I2S blocks"

msgid "显式 `master-tx-blocks`、`master-rx-blocks`、`master-duplex-blocks` 和对应 `slave-*` 模式使用独立的连续 state/config。普通有限实例不增加运行时字段； 同一 `nx_audio_port_t` 的只读 ops 追加可选 `start_blocks`，有限表该项为 NULL。 连续表不提供有限 `submit`／`cancel`，会话通过已有 `service`／`stop` 推进和退出。 factory 仍然只查询已有静态对象，不把一个控制器同时装成两种 personality。"
msgstr "Explicit `master-tx-blocks`, `master-rx-blocks`, `master-duplex-blocks` and corresponding `slave-*` modes use separate continuous state/configuration. Ordinary finite instances gain no runtime fields. The read-only ops of the same `nx_audio_port_t` gain an optional `start_blocks`; the finite table leaves it NULL. The continuous table provides no finite `submit`/`cancel`: sessions progress and exit through the existing `service`/`stop`. Factory lookup still returns existing static objects and never assembles one controller as two simultaneous personalities."

msgid "调用者准备 `nx_audio_blocks_request_t.base`、显式 `block_bytes` 及所选 TX／RX `nx_stream_t`。两方向控制、slot 元数据和全部 capacity 必须互不重叠；每块是完整 音频 frame 的整数倍，每方向最多 65535 个 DMA halfwords。格式仍遵守上述原始 halfword／slot 合同，不复制、重排或转换数据。"
msgstr "The caller prepares `nx_audio_blocks_request_t.base`, explicit `block_bytes` and the selected TX/RX `nx_stream_t` objects. Controls, slot metadata and all buffer capacities of both directions must be disjoint. Each block contains an integer number of complete audio frames, with at most 65535 DMA halfwords per direction. The raw halfword/slot contract above still applies; data is never copied, reordered or converted."

msgid "TX 至少提供两个 READY block。provider 取得两个精确 consumer token，作为两个 DMA bank；每次可信 TC 后先取得下一块、替换非活动地址，再回读 CT／事件和时间预算， 最后归还旧 block。数据生产者通过原 stream 的 producer 操作补充后续 READY block。 RX 至少提供三个 FREE slot，复用 posted producer 同时借用两个 FILLING bank； 先取得第三块并完成相同的地址替换证明，才 FIFO 发布旧块。消费者使用原 stream acquire／release，仍可持有已发布块；provider 不覆盖 READY／BORROWED。"
msgstr "TX supplies at least two READY blocks. The provider acquires two exact consumer tokens as the two DMA banks. After each trustworthy TC, it first acquires the next block and replaces the inactive address, then reads back CT/events and checks the time budget before returning the old block. The data producer replenishes subsequent READY blocks through the original stream producer operations. RX supplies at least three FREE slots and reuses the posted producer to borrow two FILLING banks concurrently. It acquires the third block and proves the same address replacement before publishing the old block in FIFO order. Consumers use the original stream acquire/release and may retain published blocks; the provider never overwrites READY/BORROWED storage."

msgid "装配必须声明 `max_sample_rate_hz` 和 `max_service_gap_us`。master 的精确有理数 rate 不得超过前者；slave 的值是调用者必须保证的外部 clock 上界，rate 查询仍为 0/0 unknown。block 时长必须大于两倍 service 上界加两微秒裕量。每次 service 及地址替换前后观察真实单调时间、CT、硬件和 IRQ 锁存 TC／error；无法区分多次回卷 时停止并报告 LOSS，不从一个 CT bit 推造精确丢失样本数。IRQ 只锁存事实；source OVR 等 level 错误先撤 ERRIE，使任务能够执行完整排空。"
msgstr "The assembly must declare `max_sample_rate_hz` and `max_service_gap_us`. The exact rational master rate must not exceed the former. For a slave, this value is an external-clock upper bound the caller must uphold; the rate query still returns unknown 0/0. A block must last longer than twice the service bound plus a two-microsecond margin. Each service and both sides of address replacement observe actual monotonic time, CT, hardware and IRQ-latched TC/error facts. If multiple wraps cannot be distinguished, the session stops and reports LOSS; one CT bit never invents an exact number of lost samples. IRQs only latch facts. Level errors such as source OVR first withdraw ERRIE so the task can perform complete drain."

msgid "这些预算不是物理吞吐资格。持续运行要求应用在预算内推进 service、补充 TX READY 和归还 RX consumer blocks；没有隐藏 worker、默认 buffer pool、软件补静音或自动 重放政策。违反外部时钟或服务预算时，硬件在软件观察之前的欠载、回卷及 wire 行为 不能由软件结果追溯保证。duplex 两方向独立观察 bank，内存块不附加伪造的 aperture 时间或相位同步测量。"
msgstr "These budgets do not establish physical throughput qualification. Continuous operation requires the application to call service within budget, replenish TX READY blocks and return RX consumer blocks. There is no hidden worker, default buffer pool, software silence insertion or automatic replay policy. If external-clock or service bounds are violated, software results cannot retrospectively guarantee underrun, wrap or wire behavior that occurred before observation. Duplex observes each direction independently; memory blocks carry no invented aperture times or measured phase synchronization."

msgid "slave TX 的 ACTIVE 仍要求 DR prefill、NDTR=N−1、TXE0、三个实际微秒 tick 和 稳定 idle CK／WS；之后才能启动外部 clock。stop 先撤请求、观察 DMA／serializer／ IRQ 与全部地址真正退出，再归还两个 TX token 和撤销未完成 RX fills。主 RX 停止 额外观察实际 DWT 的 terminal bit 时间；当前部分 block 不发布为完整 frame。 拒撤、地址不清、未退出 IRQ 或 time-domain 历史丢失时保留 QUARANTINED 会话和 全部存储，Platform close 不归还其时钟。普通可恢复拒撤可在同一实例重试；历史丢失 不因把寄存器恢复成 reset 外观而自动解除。"
msgstr "Slave TX ACTIVE still requires DR prefill, NDTR=N-1, TXE0, three actual microsecond ticks and stable idle CK/WS. Only then may external clocks start. Stop first withdraws requests and observes actual DMA/serializer/IRQ and address detachment before returning both TX tokens and aborting incomplete RX fills. Master RX stop additionally observes the terminal-bit time with actual DWT. The current partial block is never published as a complete frame. Refused withdrawal, uncleared addresses, unjoined IRQs or lost time-domain history retain the QUARANTINED session and all storage; Platform close retains its clocks. An ordinary recoverable withdrawal refusal can be retried on the same instance. Lost history is not cleared automatically by making registers look reset-like."

msgid "`SETTLED` 是 provider 对会话及 producer/consumer 权限的最后访问。之前发布的 RX consumer loans 继续有效，应用需独立 join 它们再回收 stream 或 buffers；未被 DMA 取得的 TX READY blocks 仍在原队列。`base.transferred` 在选择 RX 时统计已发布 RX 字节，否则统计已脱离 DMA 并归还的 TX 字节；错误／取消也可返回先前完整前缀， 不代表实际播放／采样的精确 wire frame 数。整段持续会话可显式使用 `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`，或由一个绝对 deadline 触发有界排空。"
msgstr "`SETTLED` is the provider's final access to the session and producer/consumer rights. Previously published RX consumer loans remain valid; the application must join them separately before reclaiming streams or buffers. TX READY blocks never acquired by DMA remain in the original queue. With RX selected, `base.transferred` counts published RX bytes; otherwise it counts TX bytes detached from DMA and returned. Errors/cancellation may therefore report a previously completed prefix, never an exact count of physical playback/capture wire frames. A continuous session may explicitly use `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`, or one absolute deadline may initiate bounded drain."

msgid "F446／F479 SAI1 有限帧"
msgstr "F446/F479 SAI1 finite frames"

msgid "SAI1 复用公共 `audio` request、frame stream 与借用状态机，使用独立 C provider， 不经过 I2S 运行时转发层。首批只选择六种 `master-*`／`slave-*` 的 `tx`、`rx`、`duplex`；不声明 SAI2、连续 blocks、稀疏 slots、AC97、SPDIF、PDM 或软件格式转换。`frame_sync_*`、有效位宽、slot 宽度、偏移、位序和采样边沿都是 显式静态配置，不能把 I2S 的 `standard` 或 PLLI2S 参数塞入 SAI 配置。"
msgstr "SAI1 reuses the public `audio` request, frame stream and borrowing state machine through a separate C provider, without an I2S runtime forwarding layer. The initial provider selects six finite `master-*`/`slave-*` `tx`, `rx` and `duplex` modes. It does not declare SAI2, continuous blocks, sparse slots, AC97, SPDIF, PDM or software format conversion. `frame_sync_*`, significant width, slot width, offset, bit order and sample edge are explicit static configuration. I2S `standard` and PLLI2S parameters are not SAI configuration."

msgid "时钟源 block"
msgstr "Clock-source block"

msgid "AF6 基础 pads"
msgstr "Base AF6 pads"

msgid "可选数据与 MCLK"
msgstr "Optional data and MCLK"

msgid "DMA2"
msgstr "DMA2"

msgid "A"
msgstr "A"

msgid "PE4 FS_A、PE5 SCK_A、PE6 SD_A"
msgstr "PE4 FS_A, PE5 SCK_A, PE6 SD_A"

msgid "duplex 接 PE3 SD_B；MCLK_A 为 PE2"
msgstr "Duplex adds PE3 SD_B; MCLK_A uses PE2"

msgid "A 为 stream1/channel0"
msgstr "A uses stream1/channel0"

msgid "B"
msgstr "B"

msgid "PF9 FS_B、PF8 SCK_B、PE3 SD_B"
msgstr "PF9 FS_B, PF8 SCK_B, PE3 SD_B"

msgid "duplex 接 PE6 SD_A；MCLK_B 为 PF7"
msgstr "Duplex adds PE6 SD_A; MCLK_B uses PF7"

msgid "B 为 stream4/channel1"
msgstr "B uses stream4/channel1"

msgid "source block 由精确 route 推导，不额外维护一份 authored block 选择。simplex 可以 TX 或 RX；duplex 的 source 为 TX，另一 block 为同步 RX。一个静态 owner 独占整个 SAI1、两个 blocks 与共享 IRQ87，处理两条 DMA 路线；没有两个相互竞争的全局 owner。"
msgstr "The exact route determines the source block; there is no duplicate authored block selection. Simplex can transmit or receive. Duplex uses the source for TX and the other block for synchronous RX. One static owner exclusively owns SAI1, both blocks and shared IRQ87, handling both DMA routes. There are no competing global owners."

msgid "master 只消费 System ClockPlan 的 `pll_sai.sai1`，禁止驱动晚改 PLLM、PLLSRC、 PLLSAI 或 SAI mux。F446 的 auxiliary M 独立，F479 与主 PLL 输入共享 M；共同 PLLSAI N／M、SAI Q／postQ 与可选 LTDC R／postR 都由同一个 System owner 校验和撤回。 LTDC-only 不要求 SAI，SAI-only 不取得 R；兼容 Q＋R 才能同时选择。普通 master 使用 `mckdiv=0` 的除1或 `2*mckdiv`，frame bits 必须为二次幂；rate 是精确有理数。 `no_divider=true` 时禁止 MCLK、要求 mckdiv0，rate 为 kernel/frame bits，不强行取整。"
msgstr "Master consumes only `pll_sai.sai1` from the System ClockPlan. The driver must not change PLLM, PLLSRC, PLLSAI or the SAI mux later. F446 has independent auxiliary M; F479 shares M with the main PLL input. The same System owner validates and withdraws shared PLLSAI N/M, SAI Q/postQ and optional LTDC R/postR. LTDC-only does not require SAI; SAI-only does not acquire R. Q+R can be selected together only when compatible. Ordinary master uses divisor1 for `mckdiv=0` or `2*mckdiv`; frame bits must be a power of two and the rate is an exact rational number. `no_divider=true` forbids MCLK, requires mckdiv0 and reports kernel/frame bits without forcing an integer rate."

msgid "所有模式保守要求 APB2 严格大于两倍 SCK；slave 的 `max_bit_clock_hz` 是调用者保证的 外部上界，rate 仍为0/0 unknown。该全模式约束直接覆盖 DS11118 Table67 脚注2； F446 使用同一保守边界，不把其不同脚注说成同一条款。实际选择 PE2／PF7 MCLK 输出时 还要求共同已审 2.048–45MHz 范围；没有 MCLK pad 的低速精确分数模式不附加任意最小 采样率。引脚使用两份数据手册表中的 OSPEEDR 二进制10，保留 Platform 原恢复收条。 这些是静态准入条件，不是外部振荡器精度、吞吐或负载电气测量。"
msgstr "All modes conservatively require APB2 strictly greater than twice SCK. A slave's `max_bit_clock_hz` is the caller-guaranteed external upper bound; the rate remains unknown 0/0. This all-mode constraint covers DS11118 Table67 footnote2 directly. F446 uses the same conservative bound without claiming that its different footnote states the same rule. Selecting PE2/PF7 MCLK additionally requires the shared reviewed 2.048–45MHz range. Low-rate exact-fraction modes without an MCLK pad have no arbitrary minimum sample rate. Pads use OSPEEDR binary10 from the two datasheets and retain Platform's original restoration receipt. These are static admission conditions, not physical oscillator, throughput or electrical-load measurements."

msgid "官方 `HAL_SAI_Init` 负责联合冷态格式配置，Handle 仅在栈上存在。已保留的真实 SDK 回归表明其 DMA start／stop／abort 路径含私有等待或未完成撤回，不能直接满足 Nexus 借用合同；热态因此使用有界 C DMA 协议，不自造音频算法或修改厂商库。IRQ 只锁存 事实与首个错误，显式 service 推进；发送 FIFO prime 不在 IRQ 内忙等。"
msgstr "Official `HAL_SAI_Init` configures the combined cold format using a stack-only Handle. Retained real-SDK regressions show private waits or incomplete withdrawal in its DMA start/stop/abort paths, which cannot directly satisfy the Nexus borrowing contract. The hot path therefore uses a bounded C DMA protocol, without inventing an audio algorithm or modifying vendor code. IRQs only latch observations and the first error; explicit service advances progress. TX FIFO priming never busy-waits inside an IRQ."

msgid "启用前后都重新检查绝对 deadline 和 System epoch。已受理后的超时、clock 历史丢失、 DMA 地址拒清或 serializer／IRQ 未退出，均保留 request 与 loans；不是返回拒绝就 归还内存。正常关闭先停 source、再同步 sink，确认完整帧／FIFO、DMA、IRQ 与地址全部 脱离，才发布 SETTLED。System 看到仍在用的 SAI／LTDC gate 会保持时钟与 time epoch。"
msgstr "Both before and after enabling hardware, the provider rechecks the absolute deadline and System epoch. An accepted timeout, lost clock history, refused DMA-address clear or unjoined serializer/IRQ retains the request and loans. Returning a rejection cannot reclaim already borrowed memory. Normal close stops the source, then the synchronous sink, and publishes SETTLED only after complete frames/FIFOs, DMA, IRQs and all addresses have detached. System retains clocks and its time epoch while SAI/LTDC gates are still borrowed."

msgid "`tests/contracts/stm32f4_sai/` 提供 F446／F479 的 master／slave 最小软件装配； `consumer.c` 只链接 factory、布局、frame planner 与生命周期，不实际传输音频。 GoogleTest 模型验证 C 生命周期与故障协议，ARM ELF／Source SDK 验证真实选编和符号； 实板外部时钟、引脚波形、FIFO 余量、音质和长时间运行需要独立物理执行。"
msgstr "`tests/contracts/stm32f4_sai/` contains minimal master/slave software assemblies for F446/F479. `consumer.c` links the factory, layout, frame planner and lifecycle but transfers no audio. GoogleTest models validate C lifecycle and fault protocols. ARM ELF/Source SDK checks validate actual source selection and symbols. External clocks, pad waveforms, FIFO margin, audio quality and long-duration operation require separate physical execution."

msgid "装配与验证入口"
msgstr "Assembly and validation"

msgid "`tests/contracts/f407_capture_audio/` 是外部 software-only Board 夹具，覆盖 VE RAW12 配 I2S2 duplex、ZG embedded RAW blocks 配 I2S3、ZG RAW14、JPEG 以及 I2S3 MCLK。 `jpeg_blocks/ve-jpeg-blocks.toml` 复用 VE 软件路线，独立强类型消费者显式提供三个 4096 B bank 并调用 start／service／acquire／release／stop；不增加其他有限夹具的 RAM。 它们不修改公共 Board 的接线事实。`tools/configure/test_f407_capture_audio_configuration.py` 检查严格字段、typed IR、真实 claims、pure factory 及固定生命周期连接。 `tests/google/f407_capture_audio_test.cpp` 编译真实 C11 owner 和官方 DCMI cold Init， 只替换 CPU／MMIO 边界；失败 drain、迟到 IRQ、CT 歧义、欠替代 buffer、原始借用及 多实例共享时钟均在同一个完整程序中执行。模型结果、ARM ELF 和 HIL 分别验收； 本软件工作不执行 HIL。"
msgstr "`tests/contracts/f407_capture_audio/` provides external software-only Board fixtures: VE RAW12 with I2S2 duplex, ZG embedded RAW blocks with I2S3, ZG RAW14, JPEG and I2S3 MCLK. `jpeg_blocks/ve-jpeg-blocks.toml` reuses the VE software route. Its independent strongly typed consumer supplies three 4096 B banks and calls start/service/acquire/release/stop; it adds no RAM to other finite fixtures. These fixtures do not change public Board wiring facts. `tools/configure/test_f407_capture_audio_configuration.py` checks strict fields, typed IR, actual claims, pure factory lookup and fixed lifecycle connections. `tests/google/f407_capture_audio_test.cpp` compiles the real C11 owner and official DCMI cold Init, replacing only CPU/MMIO boundaries. The same complete program covers failed drain, late IRQs, ambiguous CT, exhausted replacements, original borrowing and shared multi-instance clocks. Model results, ARM ELF and HIL are accepted separately; this software work executes no HIL."

msgid "旧 I2S2 专用角色迁移"
msgstr "Retiring the dedicated I2S2 role"

msgid "`sky-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` 和 `qiming-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` 保留参考输入名称，改用 随 SDK 交付的 `f407-audio-reference/ve`、`zg` 软件 Board，不声明 Sky 或启明实板 音频接线。标准 `[audio.sound]` 与 factory／Platform 已覆盖原 Philips stereo16 引脚、DMA 和完整借用职责；旧 `[i2s2]`、组件、手动 owner 初始化及专用 driver 已删除。"
msgstr "`sky-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` and `qiming-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` retain their reference filenames but use shipped `f407-audio-reference/ve` and `zg` software Boards without claiming Sky or Qiming physical audio wiring. Standard `[audio.sound]`, factory and Platform cover the original Philips stereo16 pads, DMA and complete borrowing duties. Legacy `[i2s2]`, its component, manual owner initialization and dedicated driver are removed."

msgid "旧程序中仍有效的回归转入同一个 capture/audio 程序："
msgstr "Still-valid regressions from the old program move into the same capture/audio program:"

msgid "原职责"
msgstr "Original duty"

msgid "保留的独立行为验证"
msgstr "Retained independent behavior checks"

msgid "prefill、冻结时钟、WS 丢失"
msgstr "Prefill, frozen clocks and lost WS"

msgid "真实三微秒 tick、DR/NDTR/TXE、保持 idle 后才 ACTIVE"
msgstr "Actual three-microsecond ticks, DR/NDTR/TXE, and idle preserved before ACTIVE"

msgid "TC／NDTR 不能归还借用"
msgstr "TC/NDTR cannot release a borrow"

msgid "新读 TXE 后再读 BSY，取消／deadline／停止失败保留 loan"
msgstr "Fresh TXE before BSY; cancellation/deadline/stop failures retain the loan"

msgid "DMA／IRQ／地址退出失败"
msgstr "Failed DMA/IRQ/address withdrawal"

msgid "duplex 和 TX 的完整借用、停止重试及已取得的线上排空证明"
msgstr "Complete duplex/TX borrows, stop retries and already-obtained wire-drain proof"

msgid "几何、DMA 权限、计数上限"
msgstr "Geometry, DMA permissions and count limits"

msgid "非空防溢出整块 rows、禁止 padding、131068B stereo16 上界"
msgstr "Nonempty nonwrapping complete rows, no padding, 131068B stereo16 bound"

msgid "伪造及别名控制"
msgstr "Forged and aliased controls"

msgid "copied／stale／未对齐 loan、request 落在未用 payload capacity 尾部"
msgstr "Copied/stale/misaligned loans and a request placed in unused payload-capacity tail"

msgid "read-clear 与历史丢失"
msgstr "Read-clear and lost history"

msgid "首次 SR 故障、reset／DMA gate／时基／epoch 丢失后永久 quarantine"
msgstr "Initial SR faults and permanent quarantine after reset/DMA-gate/timebase/epoch loss"

msgid "SETTLED 最后访问"
msgstr "SETTLED as final access"

msgid "provider 清除所有 payload 引用，控制块 PROT_NONE 后迟到 IRQ 和 close"
msgstr "All payload references detached before late IRQ/close with control storage set PROT_NONE"

msgid "执行上下文及共享状态"
msgstr "Execution context and shared state"

msgid "privilege／ISR／三个 incoming masks、共享 PLL、邻 DMA、IRQ 原优先级"
msgstr "Privilege/ISR/three incoming masks, shared PLL, neighboring DMA and original IRQ priorities"

msgid "原手动 face／storage ABI 的布局检查随该 ABI 退出。原 System 特殊 gate 分支的三项 测试只证明手动调用者已自行 join 的前提，随该架构删除；标准 Platform 现在实际调用 audio close，无法完成借用排空就拒绝资源撤回。cold 状态及共享 GPIO／DMA 门由已有 Platform 资源 owner 统一取得，factory 不再允许调用者构造第二个硬件 owner。 linked provider 验证沿用普通 generated face→共享只读方法表→真实私有函数的同一机制， 无需专用角色、公共 opaque storage 或另一个硬件发现入口。"
msgstr "Layout checks of the manual face/storage ABI retire with that ABI. Three tests of special System gates proved only that manual callers had joined their users and retire with that architecture. Standard Platform now actually calls audio close and refuses resource withdrawal without complete borrow drain. Existing Platform resource owners acquire cold state and shared GPIO/DMA gates. Factory no longer lets callers construct a second hardware owner. Linked-provider verification uses the same generated-face→shared-read-only-method-table→actual-private-function mechanism without a dedicated role, public opaque storage or another discovery entry point."

